==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 17 units or higher. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first. The way to beat this stage is simple: [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Legs]] and an attacker, even just [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO]], are all you need to win, assuming your level isn't too low. Add combos, better units or a Zombie Killer and this stage will stand no chance even with a much lower level cap than recommended.

